WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.590
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:14.830
Last time: robots follow algorithms

3
00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:23.500
Chapter 4 · Data — What Computers Remember

4
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:32.460
How does a game remember your score?

5
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:37.210
Meet Aarav, the cricket game fan

6
00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:45.630
52 runs! His best score ever!

7
00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:52.250
Dinner time! Tablet switched off

8
00:00:52.250 --> 00:01:01.470
"Welcome back, Aarav! High score: 52"

9
00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:11.580
How did the game remember? Think!

10
00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:22.700
The game saved the facts, like a notebook

11
00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:27.890
Those saved facts are called DATA

12
00:01:27.890 --> 00:01:34.300
Data = facts a computer stores

13
00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:45.660
Name · Score · Picture → all data!

14
00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:49.400
Data is everywhere!

15
00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:58.610
Name · Class · Marks · Score · Nickname

16
00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:10.300
A photo saved on a tablet is data too!

17
00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:17.890
What does a school computer store?

18
00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:28.100
Names · Roll numbers · Marks · Phone numbers

19
00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:40.790
Tastes and feelings? Not data!

20
00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:48.300
Marks on loose slips, stuffed in a bag

21
00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:58.880
"What did Rohan get?" Dig, dig, dig…

22
00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:10.400
Register: names in ABC order, marks beside

23
00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:20.710
Computers keep tidy lists → find data fast

24
00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:38.840
List A or List B? Which is quicker?

25
00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:48.570
List B! Tidy lists are quick to search

26
00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:57.090
Some data is public. Some is private.

27
00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:04.250
Public: favourite colour, team, cartoon

28
00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:15.430
Private: address, phone, birthday, password

29
00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:24.670
Strangers could find you or trick you

30
00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:31.930
Share only with trusted adults

31
00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:46.740
Public or private? Sort them!

32
00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:58.960
Address & phone: private. Colour & team: public

33
00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:12.090
Pop-up: "Type your birthday to win!"

34
00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:21.730
Don't share. Tell a trusted adult!

35
00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:37.160
Class web page: no phone numbers!

36
00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:40.860
Your turn: practice check

37
00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:51.310
Birthday: public or private? Who to tell?

38
00:05:51.310 --> 00:06:02.970
Private! Tell family or teacher only

39
00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:10.590
Data = facts: names, scores, photos

40
00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:14.000
Tidy lists beat messy piles

41
00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:18.200
Private data stays private

42
00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:21.490
Share only with trusted adults

43
00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:29.390
Chapter 4 done! Next: your capstone

44
00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:34.960
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
